# WHAT IS NOT UPLOADED TO THE BUILD (§238, rewritten for the cutover — §317.3)
#
# §238 wrote this file for the FROZEN deployment, which served the whole
# repository as static files: everything internal had to be named here or it
# was fetchable. That is not how the new stack works — Next serves `public/`
# and its own build output and nothing else, so a source file is not reachable
# whatever this file says. What this file still decides is what reaches the
# BUILD, and excluding something the build reads is not a smaller deployment,
# it is no deployment at all.
#
# THAT IS NOT A THEORY. `smp-app/` was listed here, so with the Root Directory
# pointed at it Vercel cloned the repository, deleted the app, found nothing to
# build — "Build output contains no functions, static, or services directory",
# 13ms — and published an empty deployment that answered 404 on every address:
# the door, /platform, every client and the demo. Marked Ready throughout.
#
# EVERY PATTERN IS ANCHORED WITH A LEADING SLASH, AND THAT IS LOAD-BEARING.
# .gitignore syntax matches a bare `scripts/` at ANY depth, so the previous
# file's `scripts/` would have deleted `smp-app/scripts/` — the build scripts
# themselves — the moment `smp-app/` stopped being excluded, producing the
# same empty output one log line further on. Measured before it could:
# `git ls-files -ci --exclude-from=…` named all six of them.
#
# NOTHING THE BUILD OR THE RUNTIME READS MAY APPEAR HERE, and what that is
# is asserted rather than remembered — `smp-app/checks/deploy-context.mjs`
# reads this file and refuses if it swallows anything the app reaches for.
#
# The app reads these from outside its own folder: SMP-Project-Folder/src
# (the frozen sources — at build time AND at runtime through lib/frozen.cjs),
# platform.html, sw.js, index.html, vercel.json, the manifest and the icons.

# ── Dev tooling and material that is nobody's dependency ──────────────
/design-mockups/
/ui-versions/
/specs/
/.specify/
/clients/
/.github/
/.claude/
/scripts/
/SMP-Project-Folder/mockups/

# The in-repo checks are Python and Playwright, run from a laptop, and are
# the largest thing under src/ — the one part of it nothing at build or run
# time reaches for.
/SMP-Project-Folder/src/checks/
/SMP-Project-Folder/src/__pycache__/

# ── Documentation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/*.md
/SMP-Project-Folder/*.md
